    "findings": [
      {
        "id": "df-1f757fb857ffc57887c4",
        "title": "Required owner decisions remain unresolved",
        "details": "The contract cannot begin or complete several required stages until authenticated decisions D-DARKFACTORY-L4, D-AUTOLEARN-225, D-PROOF-TRACKER-219, D-PROOF-SCHEDULE-219, D-SUPPORTED-PLATFORMS-219, and D-CAPSTONE-SIGNING-219 exist. Their placeholders and issue text grant no authority. Issue #219 must remain blocked until each applicable decision is recorded through the trusted owner-action path.",
        "path": null,
        "line": null
      },
      {
        "id": "df-dc65835313caed3d8e09",
        "title": "The dev-to-main delivery path is ambiguous",
        "details": "The pipeline requires branches from dev, while the repository default branch and all closure evidence are main. The contract does not specify PR base branches, the dev-to-main promotion step, which revision each review and CI gate evaluates, or which branch produces the release. This prevents receipts and closure evidence from proving one deterministic delivery path.",
        "path": null,
        "line": null
      },
      {
        "id": "df-d6236bf43925d7d0bd3c",
        "title": "The lane-4 rollback prerequisite has no authorised execution path",
        "details": "D-DARKFACTORY-L4 is ordered after a successful rollback drill, but the rollout definition exercises rollback in a write-enabled single lane and no separate decision authorises that prerequisite drill. The contract must either define a non-mutating rollback proof or name an authenticated, bounded authorization and evidence owner for the write-enabled drill before D-DARKFACTORY-L4 is requested.",
        "path": null,
        "line": null
      },
      {
        "id": "df-0d152a80de83eca4e0a8",
        "title": "The autolearn brake proof and authorization are circular",
        "details": "D-AUTOLEARN-225 may be recorded only after the planted-bad-adapter brake proof, while issue #225 prohibits execution before explicit owner authorization and its brake proof is executable #225 scope. The contract must define a separately authorised brake-proof-only lane or move the owner decision before that proof while limiting it to the proof.",
        "path": null,
        "line": null
      }
    ],
